! This file contains Cyrillic proper nouns that should be merged with
! all URJ and other languages using the Cyrillic alphabet.
! INITIALLY the file will contain surnames, given names and patronymics 
! that cannot be regularly derived from male given names 
! A distinction should be made for use of _ё_ and _е_
! spell-relax [ё (->) е] will be used where necessary

! The URJ-Cyrl (common Uralic Cyrillic) proper noun lexicon
! 100% equivalent to Russian
! =========================================

